  "name": "Mind Sharpener",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The infused item can send a jolt to the wearer to refocus their mind. The item has 4 charges. When the wearer fails a Constitution Saving Throw to maintain Concentration on a spell, the wearer can use its Reaction to expend 1 of the item's charges to succeed instead. The item regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.</p>",
